    },
    {
      "height": 75,
      "id": "159376c510054840",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "# Useful PF2e Reference\nhttps://2e.aonprd.com/Archetypes.aspx?ID=240",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 480,
      "x": 2420,
      "y": 1743
    },
    {
      "height": 192,
      "id": "831d4934e550a32d",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "predefined-process",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "## >< Shield Block\n\nWhen a Strike lands on you and Your Shield is not Raised you can snap it into position gaining its resistances for the hit.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 1840
    },
    {
      "height": 425,
      "id": "c9c89a415f0bed23",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "predefined-process",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "## <> Shield Bash\n Flourish\n \n Make a Strength Challenge against an Engaged target. On Critical Failure: User becomes Off Guard On Success: Deal 1+str Bludgeoning damage and make the target Off Guard. On Critical Success: Deal 1+str Bludgeoning damage and make the target and the Target becomes Stunned 1",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 273,
      "x": 2284,
      "y": 1853
    },
    {
      "height": 340,
      "id": "a85583062ee3ebe7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "predefined-process",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "## <> Shield Strike\n\nVersatile *(can be two handed we need to work out these words)*\n \nMake a strike against a Target that deals your Shields Passive AC plus **STR** as Blunt Damage. If you use 2 hands for this strike you can use double your shields Passive AC",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 2220,
      "y": 2325
    },
    {
      "height": 265,
      "id": "1ae9401ed404c080",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "predefined-process",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "## Shielded Pin\n\nWhen you have Pinned or Grappled a Creature your Size or smaller successfully while a Shield is Equipped. The Creature can not make Strikes while Pinned and you gain a +2 on Challenges to keep them pinned.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 2620,
      "y": 2060
    },
    {
      "height": 190,
      "id": "5fcd49fc413538c8",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "predefined-process",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "## <> Shield Raise \nGain a Shields Raised AC and Resistances until start of your next turn",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 2557,
      "y": 2380
    },
    {
      "height": 260,
      "id": "0adfc67d1a37f17d",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "predefined-process",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "## Disarming Block\n\nOnce per round when a Target fails to land a strike you may attempt to [Disarm](https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2383) the creature even if you do not have a free hand.\n\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 2590
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "0d99ce083861ec4f",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "#### System as Seen Last Talked on",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 420,
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 1972
    },
    {
      "height": 75,
      "id": "72c6d5fb641a6237",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "## Defense in 2 Ways",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 320,
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 1861
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "e77804f6a3c90f6f",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "AC for having Shield on your person",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 230,
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 2100
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "88b5b4376518892f",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "AC for Holding Shield Ready to use",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 220,
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 2100
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "9bf7036f4a266d92",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Active",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 120,
      "x": 1415,
      "y": 2040
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "4019dcf24df44377",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Passive",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 140,
      "x": 1165,
      "y": 2040
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "e38358e80f108e67",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Resistances for any Hit having hit your Shield",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 220,
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 2173
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "b6a1c874e23a65b8",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "### Pros",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 140,
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 2248
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "750aee4ba95a6726",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Makes Shield a Dynamic piece of kit with many Tunable parts",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 440,
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 2308
    },
    {
      "height": 90,
      "id": "207495e166aa1839",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Makes Defensive build more than buff and gear stacking as it has to play the AP game for full power",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 440,
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 2380
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "6147d51038d5b22f",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "### Issues",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 140,
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 2475
    },
    {
      "height": 85,
      "id": "a1d13ec01099eaa5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Resistance stacking making Lower dice do nothing even with basic combos like chain and Kite having a res of 4s,3p,2b",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 440,
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 2535
    },
    {
      "height": 85,
      "id": "dd4569aba7503fab",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Non passive shields (Buckler) Only Suffer under this system as they become a AP Drain to ever have value",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 440,
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 2650
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "8a85d97f47706cd7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Like DND all AC is Passive",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 230,
      "x": 1635,
      "y": 2096
    },
    {
      "height": 124,
      "id": "5bfc23f8d092c0ad",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Raising offers a flat Damage Res and possible advantage challenge roll types",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 220,
      "x": 1875,
      "y": 2096
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "e3e4e343f62a4aec",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Active",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 120,
      "x": 1930,
      "y": 2036
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "874a2756100894d4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Passive",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 140,
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 2036
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "4fbd8d50e9adbbc3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "#### Resistanceless System",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 290,
      "x": 1675,
      "y": 1972
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "1f6ca98d9c4460cb",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "### Issues",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 140,
      "x": 1780,
      "y": 2233
    },
    {
      "height": 85,
      "id": "3ce9b543b7c41b98",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "The flat damage res to all types while no longer invalidating dice on a roll still invalidate damage from them when stacked with armor",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 440,
      "x": 1645,
      "y": 2308
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "98ead6ef6f12d2ee",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "border": "invisible",
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "#### Non Shield Solution",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 290,
      "x": 1720,
      "y": 2435
    },
    {
      "height": 485,
      "id": "54812887f8882b9a",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "text": "Armor having resistances at base is main non shield through point the only way to work around this without messing with shields is intern armor.\n\nWhile these Res values have become a differentiator for some armor types armor has more than just AC as another value to mess with. Removing it as a property of armor and forcing bases to instead lean into other properties to be different. \n\nExpanding some armor types to not be bases but improvements of a base can also further help maintain why you would some types over others while allowing shields to be source for damage res without materials. (EX is making all other leather types not bases but improvements or modifications of the leather base)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 440,
      "x": 1675,
      "y": 2495
    }
  ]
}